<title>INDIA: Port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>INDIA, Oct 29 - Bombay - Berthing delays at Jawaharlal Nehru to October 18 - containers three to four days, bulk cargo nine to 11 days.</p>
</text>
